cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  SpectraFuse is an independent implementation inspired by SpectRAG, not the official SpectRAG.
  If you use the method, please cite the paper below. SpectRAG's official implementation is
  https://github.com/SightAndCite/SpectRAG.
title: "SpectraFuse: an independent implementation inspired by SpectRAG"
